<div class="standard-form">
    <p style="opacity: .8; text-align: center;">Quick and easy message drop. This works as a <strong>one way</strong> channel<br/>A <strong>two way</strong> channel can be started at the <a href="https://github.com/codaBool/terminal/issues" style="text-decoration: none">issues page</a></p>

    <p style="opacity: .8; text-align: center; max-width: 400px">Additionally it's fine to message me on Discord by searching in the <a href="https://discord.gg/foundryvtt" style="text-decoration: none">Foundry Discord</a> for <b>CodaBool</b> and sending a DM</p>

    <p style="opacity: .8; text-align: center; max-width: 400px">If you want to provide the most helpful feedback it is useful to know if the bug happens with all other modules disabled.</p>

    <fieldset>
        <legend>Report Bugs, Give Feedback, Give Suggestions
        <i class="fa-solid fa-comment-exclamation"></i></legend>
        <div class="form-group">
            <textarea rows="15" cols="30" name="feedback" style="border: none"></textarea>
        </div>
    </fieldset>

    <footer class="form-footer">
        <button type="submit" class="">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope" inert=""></i>
            <label inert="">Send Feedback</label>
        </button>
    </footer>
</div>
